{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/d9790b4063ca742ce77ebd206052671d.poster.avif?t=1757763823\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/d9790b4063ca742ce77ebd206052671d.webm?t=1757763823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Dice Baby is a casino dice-building roguelike about cheating, changing the rules and rolling the craziest combos to beat the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice, reroll them, create scoring combinations and beat the score target to move to the next round: easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist a classic  dice game into a colorful combo machine thanks to illegal special dice, board modifiers and lucky charms, all in the world's most lenient casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/5d6d775140532203629a145114a04c40.poster.avif?t=1757763823\" width=780 height=163 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/5d6d775140532203629a145114a04c40.webm?t=1757763823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorites amongst tens of special dice, each with their own rule-bending abilities. Collect them to create powerful synergies that will completely change the way you play. You can even level them up to increase their scoring potential and get an edge over the unfairly high score targets demanded by the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/d9b10b87b062c035407872a7051fd51f.poster.avif?t=1757763823\" width=780 height=203 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/d9b10b87b062c035407872a7051fd51f.webm?t=1757763823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip lucky charms to create game-breaking combos and sneaky strategies. Possibilities are endless and each run is sure to be different thanks to over 100 different charms to unlock, combined with the effects of your dice collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/e6658ef7676d6bfd0bc989786307f705.poster.avif?t=1757763823\" width=780 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/e6658ef7676d6bfd0bc989786307f705.webm?t=1757763823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lucky charms' special effects ranging from earning you more money, increasing your score or even allowing you to play new dice combinations from other games, they each have a potential to bring the dealer to their knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dice Dice Baby demo contains all the gameplay mechanics and all the cheated dices types of the full game. It is simply limited to the standard difficulty level. All base lucky charms are available but there is no unlocking new ones in the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomly generated runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 dice shapes and 9 special dice types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 36 dice synergy effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 43 base lucky charms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of possible score combinations to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Standard difficulty level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dice paints, board upgrades.. and more</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904950?t=1757763823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/ad42dc3afb28155f60d444f44009309bb81b32bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757763823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/0ad59abf3f0c70183ee2db71b15019d456a5fea0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757763823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/0ad59abf3f0c70183ee2db71b15019d456a5fea0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757763823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904950/extras/d9790b4063ca742ce77ebd206052671d.poster.avif?t=1757763823\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store